      "message": "For wifi part, as the comment mentioned in previous patch, if the keepalive slot is configured for 2 active wifi connections and it become 3*2\u003d6(may rpius@ help to answer that). How do the resource allocate? It could allocate per connection? 3 for wifi_1 and 3 for wifi_2? Or how do we configure for this kind of case?",
